.* DEVICE: the task menu for device operations.
:PNLGRP.
:COPYR.(C) COPYRIGHT QUARTZ SYSTEMS 2026.
:CLASS NAME=OPTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 2'.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=OPTION CLASS=OPTCL.
:VAR NAME=PANELID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='DEVICE'.
:KEYL NAME=MENUKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F4 ACTION='RETURN 4'.F4=Prompt
:KEYI KEY=F9 ACTION=RETRIEVE.F9=Retrieve
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=F13 ACTION='MENU INFO'.F13=Information Assistant
:KEYI KEY=F16 ACTION='MENU MAIN'.F16=System Main menu
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=DEVICE HELP=HLPDEVICE KEYL=MENUKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1' TOPSEP=SYSNAM PANELID=PANELID.Device Operations
:MENU DEPTH='*' SCROLL=YES OPTIONS=OPTION.Select one of the following:
:MENUI OPTION=1 ACTION='CMD WRKCFGSTS CFGTYPE(*DEV)'.Work with device status
:MENUI OPTION=2 ACTION='CMD WRKDEVD DEVD(*DSP)'.Work with displays
:MENUI OPTION=3 ACTION='MENU PRINTER'.Printer
:MENUI OPTION=4 ACTION='MENU TAPE'.Tape
:MENUI OPTION=5 ACTION='MENU DISKETTE'.Diskette
:MENUI OPTION=6 ACTION='MENU CFGPCS'.Configure PC connections
:MENUI OPTION=7 ACTION='MENU OPTICAL'.Optical
:MENUI OPTION=70 ACTION='MENU CMDDEV'.Related commands
:EMENU.
:CMDLINE SIZE=LONG.Selection or command
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPDEVICE.Device Operations - Help
:P.Displays, printers and storage media: their status and the menus for
each kind of device.
:P.Type an option number or a command and press Enter. F4 prompts the
command, F9 brings the previous one back, F12 returns to the menu shown
before this one.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
